for participants, stakeholders, and society as a whole.We have ensured fair and equitable treatment of all participants and stakeholders, avoiding discrimination and ensuring that the benefits and burdens of our activities are distributed fairly.We have maintained transparency in our methods, findings, and reporting, providing clear and accessible information to stakeholders and the public. We are accountable for our actions and decisions and are open to scrutiny and feedback.We have adhered to all relevant laws, regulations, and guidelines applicable to our activities. Any potential conflicts of interest have been disclosed and managed appropriately.This statement reflects our unwavering commitment to ethical standards in all aspects of our work.Conflict of InterestAuthors declares no conflict of interest.'}, attributes={'Status': 'PubMed-not-MEDLINE', 'Owner': 'NLM'}), 'PubmedData': {'ReferenceList': [{'ReferenceList': [], 'Reference': [{'Citation': 'Leiter A, Veluswamy RR, Wisnivesky JP. The global burden of lung cancer: current status and future trends. Nature Reviews Clinical Oncology [Internet]. 2023;20:1–16. https://www.nature.com/articles/s41571-023-00798-3', 'ArticleIdList': [StringElement('37479810', attributes={'IdType': 'pubmed'})]}, {'Citation': 'Lam S, Bai C, Baldwin D, Chen Y, Connolly C, Harry de Koning, et al. Current and future perspectives on CT screening for Lung Cancer: a Road Map for 2023–2027 from the IASLC. J Thorac Oncol. 2024;19(1):36–51.', 'ArticleIdList': [StringElement('10.1016/j.jtho.2023.07.019', attributes={'IdType': 'doi'}), StringElement('PMC11253723', attributes={'IdType': 'pmc'}), StringElement('37487906', attributes={'IdType': 'pubmed'})]}, {'Citation': 'Onuigbo W. Prevalence of endobronchial metastases in lung cancer in Scotland. Ann Saudi Med. 2014;34(1):68–9.', 'ArticleIdList': [StringElement('10.5144/0256-4947.2014.68', attributes={'IdType': 'doi'}), StringElement('PMC6074939', attributes={'IdType': 'pmc'}), StringElement('24